#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.glade:513
msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Hasi aurpegia eskaneatzen"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Eskaneatu aurpegi-eredua"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ezin da aurpegiaren eredua gorde"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Eskaneatu bigarren eredua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ezin izan da bigarren eredua grabatu"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Zure lehen eredua gordeta dago, beraz aurpegi bidezko saio-hasierak da"
"goeneko funtzionatzen du. Ziurtatu aurpegia ondo argiztatuta eta erdia"
"n dagoela, eta saiatu berriro — edo saltatu eta gehitu eredu bat geroa"
"go Ezarpenetatik."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Gehitu aurpegi-eredu bat (beharrezkoa)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Aurpegi bidezko saio-hasierak gutxienez aurpegi-eredu bat behar du, be"
"raz eskaneatze hau ezin da saltatu. Grabatu normalean esertzen zaren a"
"rgian. Argiztapenak aldatu egiten du kamerak zure aurpegia nola ikuste"
"n duen; beraz, pentsatu geroago Ezarpenetatik bigarren eredu bat gehit"
"zea, beste argi batean grabatua (adibidez, gauez lanparekin egun-argia"
"ren ordez)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Gehitu bigarren aurpegi-eredu bat (gomendatua)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Zure lehen eredua gordeta dago. Argiztapenak aldatu egiten du kamerak "
"zure aurpegia nola ikusten duen: egun-argiz grabatutako eredu batek hu"
"ts egin dezake gauez lanpen azpian (edo alderantziz), eta orduan Ubunt"
"u Hello-k denbora agortzen du desblokeatu beharrean. Beste argi batean"
" grabatutako bigarren eredu batek ezagutza fidagarri mantentzen du egu"
"neko edozein ordutan."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Aldatu lehenik argiztapena: piztu edo itzali gelako argia edo mahaiko "
"lanpara, jarri leihoari bizkarra emanda, edo jantzi noizean behin erab"
"iltzen dituzun betaurrekoak. Ondoren begiratu zuzenean kamerara eta sa"
"katu Eskaneatu."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello konfigurazioa"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> TPM h"
"ardwarea eta tresnak egiaztatzen..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> TPM h"
"ardwarea detektatu da. <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatikoki instalatzen..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> Hardw"
"are TPM 2.0 aktiboa. Zure pasahitza modu seguruan itxiko da TPM barrua"
"n."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> TPM h"
"ardwarea detektatu da, baina <i>tpm2-tools</i>ren instalazio automatik"
"oak huts egin du. Exekutatu <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Softwarean oinarritutako kredentzialen cachean itzultzea."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> ez da"
" detektatu TPM hardwarerik. Softwarean oinarritutako kredentzialen cac"
"hea erabiliz (AES-256-GCM)."

